[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
This version uses password metadata format 4 and signed CSRF tokens.
STOP all old servers before migrating existing data. Loading this module
will refuse legacy metadata rather than silently rewrite plaintext passwords.
Read %%DATADIR%%/SECURITY-MIGRATION-ja.md and create a verified backup first.
The offline tools are in %%PREFIX%%/libexec/mod_uploader/.
Rollback requires stopping the server and restoring the entire backup plus
the previous module/configuration/templates. Installation does not migrate
production data or automatically enable the module.
Use HTTPS with the correct UploaderBaseUrl. Existing templates and scripted
clients must send the session cookie and CSRF token on POST.
Keep admin/mail restricted and storage outside DocumentRoot/Alias.
EOM
}
]
